on a giant screen in 21 authored cinema rooms or a floating-screen void.\n\nLOCAL VIDEO: play flat, 3D, 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 videos from your headset or your home network (SMB/DLNA), with subtitles and automatic refresh-rate matching for smooth motion.\n\nWEB CINEMA: open YouTube or any website on the big screen, with a built-in pop-up blocker and the Quest keyboard.\n\nPC CONNECT (experimental): stream your Windows desktop and its audio over a USB cable or your local Wi-Fi at a steady 60 fps, with full 4:4:4 colour for sharp text. Requires the free Grand Cinema Pro app for Windows from the Microsoft Store. Pair once with a four-digit code; no account, no cloud and no tracking.\n\nMake it yours: pick any seat, adjust brightness and screen curvature, let room lights react to the picture, and turn on a music visualiser that reacts to sound.\n\nFilm clips: Spring and Sintel \u00a9 Blender Foundation | blender.org, licensed under CC BY.", "short_description": "Immersive cinema rooms for your movies, the web and your PC desktop."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://grand-cinema-pro-privacy.luckyfinch21.chatgpt.site/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Grand Cinema Pro", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N281PMBRKK7", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "